  "id": "compound",
  "term": "compound",
  "definition": "In this cognition context, a compound is a pair of separate words that combine into one meaningful, semantically coherent expression. Because the words fit together into a familiar whole, people tend to process and remember them more like a single item than like two unrelated words.",
